mspace width=\"0.167em\"></mspace></mstyle><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">¬</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span>,\nand what may a proof then write?</li>\n</ol>\n</div>","file":"ch5/counting-and-descriptions.html"}